      "prize money in gen 1 scales with the last Pokemon's level, so richer trainers are an expected side effect",
      "the level curve is computed for the default option values; raising TRAINER LEVEL % well above 15 makes you outpace it again, and BOSS LEVEL BONUS is the dial that answers that",
